#. module: hardware_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hardware_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>You didn't import demo data?</strong> You can still do it. Go to "
"Apps &gt; Industries &gt; Upgrade your Hardware Shop package and check the "
"related box."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງແມ່ນບໍ່?</strong> ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຢູ່. ໄປທີ່ ແອັບ &gt; ປະເພ"
"ດທຸລະກິດ &gt; ອັບເກຣດແພັກເກດຮ້ານຂາຍອຸປະກອນຊ່າງຂອງທ່ານ ແລ້ວໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຫ້ອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. module: hardware_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hardware_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"A free, personalized, integrated <strong><span style=\"color: #875A7B;"
"\">Website</span></strong> in a few clicks. Start receiving orders directly "
"in Odoo and go live with your <strong><span style=\"color: #875A7B;\">E-"
"shop</span></strong> in a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"<strong><span style=\"color: #875A7B;\">ເວັບໄຊ</span></strong> ທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງ, ປັບແຕ່ງ"
"ໄດ້ຕາມໃຈ ແລະ ໃຊ້ຟຣີ ພຽງແຕ່ກົດບໍ່ເທົ່າໃດບາດ. ເລີ່ມຮັບລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ໂດຍກົງໃນ Odoo ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ "
"<strong><span style=\"color: #875A7B;\">ຮ້ານຄ້າອອນລາຍ</span></strong> ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ພ"
"າຍໃນບໍ່ເທົ່າໃດນາທີ."

#. module: hardware_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hardware_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Ace Hardware is already registered in your database; select it using the "
"\"Customer\" button."
msgstr ""
"Ace Hardware ໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານຮຽບຮ້ອຍແລ້ວ; ເລືອກລາຍການນີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ \"ລູກຄ້າ\"."

#. module: hardware_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hardware_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid "Add your customer, and the product they want."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມລູກຄ້າຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ສິນຄ້າທີ່ພວກເຂົາຕ້ອງການ."

#. module: hardware_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hardware_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Any specific manufacture process in your shop? (Cutting wood panels, "
"assemblies...). Try the <strong><span style=\"color: #875A7B;\">Manufacture "
"App</span></strong>"
msgstr ""
"ມີຂະບວນການຜະລິດສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງຢູ່ໃນຮ້ານຂອງທ່ານບໍ່? (ການຕັດແຜ່ນໄມ້, ການປະກອບ...). ລອງໃຊ້ "
"<strong><span style=\"color: #875A7B;\">ແອັບການຜະລິດ</span></strong>"

